{"texts":[{"text":"Desi boy at heart. My first brush with scale was growing sugarcane; then somehow I ended up building software for millio","bbox":{"x":430,"y":267,"w":560,"h":160},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"19px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"-0.19px","lineHeight":"26.6px","textTransform":"none","color":"#1d1d1f","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"We’re building a safer way to resell tickets. Sellers prove ownership using a ZK proof, buyers pay through the platform,","bbox":{"x":430,"y":783,"w":580,"h":40},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"It’s live on web, iOS, and Android, with 5K+ signups, a 2K-member WhatsApp community, and $20K+ worth of tickets sold.","bbox":{"x":430,"y":834,"w":580,"h":40},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"I care about how a thing feels more than how it's supposed to be built. is what ships.","bbox":{"x":430,"y":447,"w":520,"h":40},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Whatever feels right to the eye","bbox":{"x":430,"y":448,"w":507,"h":37},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#1d1d1f","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Founder","bbox":{"x":430,"y":723,"w":580,"h":20},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#86868b","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Reticket started after I saw how difficult it was to trust someone selling a ticket online.","bbox":{"x":430,"y":753,"w":580,"h":20},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"aniket@reticket.in","bbox":{"x":220,"y":846,"w":112,"h":22},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"12px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"18.6px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Aniket Chaudhary","bbox":{"x":482,"y":180,"w":117,"h":18},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"17.5px","textTransform":"none","color":"#1d1d1f","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"Product Engineer","bbox":{"x":482,"y":198,"w":117,"h":16},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"16.25px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"left"},{"text":"2025 – now","bbox":{"x":939,"y":703,"w":71,"h":20},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#86868b","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Reticket","bbox":{"x":430,"y":703,"w":63,"h":20},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"20.15px","textTransform":"none","color":"#1d1d1f","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"if you like writing emails:","bbox":{"x":220,"y":826,"w":112,"h":10},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"10px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"10px","textTransform":"none","color":"#86868b","textAlign":"start"},{"text":"Follow me on","bbox":{"x":1123,"y":272,"w":79,"h":13},"fontFamily":"GeistSans, \"GeistSans Fallback\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","lineHeight":"13px","textTransform":"none","color":"#6e6e73","textAlign":"start"}],"bodyBg":"#f5f5f7","dominantBgs":[{"color":"#f5f5f7","area":1294704},{"color":"#111111","area":1296}]}